{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "0f06a722833efa0b99ca89cad68c00583c75f1df57b9eac4a516ee9821314165", "ja": "ツアーの宣伝のため、名古屋のラジオ番組に\r\n出演した4人。仕事を終え東京へ戻った朋花\r\nは、返却し忘れていた学校の図書室の本を見\r\nつける。返すために登校してみると、居合わ\r\nせた女子生徒に、一通の手紙を渡され……？", "zh": "为了宣传巡演，朋花与4人一同参加了名古屋的广播节目。结束工作返回东京后，她发现了自己忘记归还的学校图书室的书。\n为了归还书而回到学校，却被恰好在场的女学生递来一封信……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "28c40083c210f02ae4c25fe4f24599988f2e7b5cb442f7ca6c15f896f116c5ab", "ja": "（今日は名古屋で地方ラジオ局に出演だ！\nLOVERS HEARTの宣伝、頼んだぞ！）", "zh": "（今天要在名古屋出演地方广播节目！LOVERS HEART的宣传就拜托你了！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1001_radiodj", "source_sha256": "92a434c27a6772c5206247639e9076cefc156d6489fd9007be0cda981caf7cf4", "ja": "ここで、ゲストの765プロのみなさんに質問です！\n名古屋にはどんなイメージがありますか？", "zh": "接下来想问问作为嘉宾的765位制作人！  \n大家对名古屋有什么印象呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1002_019min", "source_sha256": "a477b555bec8ee11dc4075e1c66a18e17732c88aefc22b940d8a115a25959fc3", "ja": "名古屋といえば、手羽先、味噌カツ、ひつまぶし……\nやっぱり、おいしいものがたくさんありますよね！", "zh": "说到名古屋，就是鸡翅、味噌炸猪排、鳗鱼饭三吃……\n果然还是有好多好吃的东西呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1003_019min", "source_sha256": "ea0bfc6567bc97d3b65c7f695c6bca892765ea2300fd6abda98ba043feaa7195", "ja": "味はもちろんだけど、作り方も知りたいな～。\nあっ、もちろん衣装が着られる範囲で食べますよ！", "zh": "味道自不用说，连做法我也很想知道呢～。\n啊，当然我会在穿得下演出服的限度内吃的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1004_005yay", "source_sha256": "8fbbff39aefe741deb77e227667d1bd229818eacb4e0f4a078a8c9ab211926db", "ja": "食べ過ぎで、お腹をこわしちゃうかも……。\nでも、どれもおいしそうで選べないですー。", "zh": "吃得太多的话，可能会把肚子吃坏……可是每一样看起来都好好吃，我实在选不出来。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1005_radiodj", "source_sha256": "57f8cc6e4f2faab25af2290b8a22978066bcfcb73bb443f0f33d63d428eb1365", "ja": "ふふっ、その時はぜひお土産で。ご家族にも名古屋の\n味を楽しんでほしいですから！　他にはどうですか？", "zh": "呵呵，到时候请务必带些特产回来。因为我也希望您的家人能品尝一下名古屋的风味！其他的呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1006_031tom", "source_sha256": "10ff343a7afe01659469e7ed88669b970ff3cf98559e42fe56e5b19fbe1e6bba", "ja": "歴史のイメージもありますね～。熱田神宮には\n三種の神器のひとつ、草薙剣がありますし。", "zh": "也有历史方面的印象呢～。热田神宫里还有三种神器之一的草薙剑。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1007_026yur", "source_sha256": "507b44a6cf9c329e62b34320079fac1acc1477326ebcf900ba73f81f41525807", "ja": "確か、信長と秀吉が尾張の出身ですもんね！\n家康はお隣の三河になりますけど。", "zh": "对了，信长和秀吉都是尾张出身的嘛！家康的话就是隔壁的三河了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1008_031tom", "source_sha256": "f70ee96b44776dd82b92a1dc279688b45986b525311bbef1a7bb096a690cdd0a", "ja": "三河といえば、劇場に縁のありそうなアイドルが\nいますが……そこに囚われる聖母ではありません～。", "zh": "说到三河，剧场里似乎有位和那里颇有渊源的偶像，不过……我可不是会被那种事束缚住的圣母哦～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1009_031tom", "source_sha256": "b9396b7c465c175fd1a72e944d297cba7b429f2a4f63a13d238eae6932b20474", "ja": "中央エリアの子豚ちゃん全員に、愛と新曲をお届け\nしますよ～。聖母の愛は、別け隔てありませんから～。", "zh": "给中央区域所有的小猪猪们送上爱与新歌哦～圣母的爱不分彼此～", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1010_019min", "source_sha256": "e2dc3e6c764da8620e92355e67066e3908700596d7fe2c81c313373e28199552", "ja": "そうそう！　今回のツアーでは、私達4人で新曲を\n披露しちゃいます！　出来たてほやほやですよ♪", "zh": "对对！这次的巡演，我们4人要一起为大家带来新歌！是刚刚完成的新鲜歌曲哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1011_026yur", "source_sha256": "c8e10860c18f08a3325b0ab658b32ee33102673b19ac6e6e0f06c4c577a54472", "ja": "テーマは『二次元と三次元の恋』……このワードに\nピンと来た人は、絶対にチェックしてほしいです！", "zh": "主题是“二次元与三次元的恋爱”……对这个词有所共鸣的人，一定要来关注哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1012_005yay", "source_sha256": "cbccd6ce950ab07e9d352ad9aaeec9c990f6efd857c7bf89eda2fffd8f1777aa", "ja": "聞いてると、思わず胸がきゅ～ってなっちゃうと\n思います！　たくさんの人に聞いてほしいです！", "zh": "听着听着，胸口会忍不住揪紧起来的！希望有很多人都能听到！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1013_null", "source_sha256": "c1fbc6dbdf0ca3358658bda30da4eabec7985a55bcf8c956d24f7912b6f024cc", "ja": "ラジオ収録後……", "zh": "广播录制结束后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1014_p", "source_sha256": "63b7bfebbd68283476e5eb33dd2c559ba4c254d751d9bc5dff23b02d6d803d89", "ja": "みんな、お疲れ様！　宣伝バッチリだったぞ！　\nとんぼ返りのスケジュールで申し訳ない限りだが……。", "zh": "大家，辛苦了！宣传做得相当到位哦！\n只是马上就得往回赶，这日程实在很过意不去就是了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "d181bce121402351a10d96acc94ed14887f69f317f4e07949c5562e1a71f3baf", "ja": "いえ、これくらい！　ツアーはもっと大変だって、\n奈緒ちゃんから聞いて備えてますから。", "zh": "没事，这点辛苦不算什么！我听奈绪说巡演要辛苦得多，所以早就做好准备了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1016_005yay", "source_sha256": "a9a843240832be5c8eb7bb2e3cd6da21c4b1a56e5afecb402677b0f6dc91f60a", "ja": "伊織ちゃんも忙しそうでしたけど……\nでも、なんだか楽しそうだったなーって！", "zh": "伊织好像也很忙……\n不过，总觉得她看起来挺开心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1017_026yur", "source_sha256": "cf6b796df7600a8d126df9a1dc069630ee130879394d0c87f00c2419b346b2c9", "ja": "うん。今はみんなが劇場を守ってくれてるんだから……\nLOVERS HEART、全力でやりきらなくちゃ！", "zh": "嗯。现在大家都在守护剧场……LOVERS HEART可得全力以赴完成才行！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1018_p", "source_sha256": "c4184307216b89b79fb9977856f04139350eafd3e573dceaeee8f44757764571", "ja": "ああ、その意気だ！ この後もそれぞれ仕事が\n詰まってるが……気合い入れていこう！", "zh": "啊，就是要有这股干劲！接下来大家也都各自有排得满满的工作……打起精神上吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1019_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1020_019min", "source_sha256": "c2a6946daba97722a9b2272e0ff018f05f288341ad461bdf31515e0e472dd8c3", "ja": "今日のお仕事、終了～っと！\nさて、私はこれからおうちの手伝いしなきゃ。", "zh": "今天的工作结束啦～！\n好了，我接下来得回家帮忙了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1021_019min", "source_sha256": "fb30ad250e08138348d3f4b3422a764c1123761adaf84aff15adf0fba4f92ce9", "ja": "ちょっと急ぎだから、お先に失礼しちゃうね！\n朋花ちゃん、あんまり遅くならないようにね～！", "zh": "因为有点赶时间，我就先走一步啦！\n朋花，别回去得太晚哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1022_031tom", "source_sha256": "a3ee8fddd8fdab601ca11600912c41b676092b58094861b1913083203aa841ed", "ja": "お疲れさまです～。……さて、私も帰宅の準備を……\nあら？　この本は、確か図書室で借りた本……。", "zh": "辛苦了～……那么，我也准备回家了……\n咦？这本书，记得是从图书室借来的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1023_031tom", "source_sha256": "9d2592d7def8ea7c4dc85815c21b5af92e66ba4aa6f4bb3f3587423f4a1326b4", "ja": "返却日は、一昨日……？　そういえば百合子さん\nから借りた本を優先していて、すっかり……。", "zh": "归还日期是……前天？说起来，我一直优先看百合子借给我的书，结果完全忘了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1024_031tom", "source_sha256": "a1f2096456a7f039dd198624c4a7e5ded98d0e2c6ca8c7a6d8d4f67385f4dea7", "ja": "……。うちの学校、土曜は\n図書室が開いているはずでしたね～。", "zh": "……。我们学校周六\n图书室应该是开着的呢～。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1025_null", "source_sha256": "9bebdf07c765ef8781483d727ad588385c76ca386d8d0d13cc75fcfe3c75f8a0", "ja": "朋花の中学校……", "zh": "朋花的初中……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1026_031tom", "source_sha256": "9edd607191b7f07d44408dab0cff7c8e609d330b3a432c48a00f7a47e2bdbfde", "ja": "ふう、無事に本も返却出来ましたね～。\nあとは……あら？", "zh": "呼，书也顺利还回去了呢～  \n接下来……咦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1027_null", "source_sha256": "f0794293d551668cbb4ef2bc617f688e086a4969627836c35a481c30bbbc0922", "ja": "……。や、やっぱり止めた方がいいかな……。\nでも、私……。", "zh": "……。还、还是停下来比较好吧……。\n可是，我……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1028_031tom", "source_sha256": "2ca3b7ea41ed94b34f2e623b7f02161f40fafebc0dc9a1739a6ed2c2675ebf25", "ja": "私の下駄箱の前で立ち止まっていますが、\nなにかご用ですか～？", "zh": "您站在我的鞋柜前，是有什么事吗～？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1029_null", "source_sha256": "1c96290218e04e1d020801497b4163fbeee59f98bfda66b1c81330973fabf7b0", "ja": "！！　てっ、天空橋先輩っ！？\n休みの日なのに、どうして……っ？", "zh": "！！天、天空桥前辈！？\n明明是休息日，为什么会在这里……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1030_null", "source_sha256": "5b3144ae0390d17c8fac628c581a0276a5ebeeae68e294f0c02bd41d4cb71739", "ja": "……！　せっ、先輩！\nこれ、受け取ってください！", "zh": "……！前、前辈！\n这个，请收下！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1031_031tom", "source_sha256": "810601b91643a95fb95385f11e512d3a3630fe50173eae2221de888f059fc077", "ja": "これは……。\n手紙？", "zh": "这……是信？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1032_null", "source_sha256": "0a966adc02ff45392102cb8e5dfc9ecd2ea89b8ba5b3982eaa96f476634a41b9", "ja": "応援してます！　\nそれだけ伝えたくて……さよなら！", "zh": "我会为你加油的！\n只是想告诉你这件事……再见！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0226_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0226_story_04_1033_031tom", "source_sha256": "e5be51f9296d98a4c147d091f6308bc841c33b210ba17ccafb48b67b74027e7a", "ja": "……。\nあの子は、確か……。", "zh": "……。\n那个孩子，我记得是……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
